<section class="page-hero page-hero--families" data-scroll-animate>
  <h1 class="page-hero__title">Reading is better together.</h1>
  <p class="page-hero__subtitle">Create a family hub, assign shelves by reading level, and celebrate milestones as a team.</p>
</section>

<section class="family-signup" data-scroll-animate>
  <div class="family-signup__content">
    <div class="family-signup__avatars">
      <div class="avatar avatar--sunny" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="avatar avatar--mint" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="avatar avatar--berry" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="family-signup__copy">
      <h2>Invite your readers &amp; start earning badges together.</h2>
      <p>
        Create a family hub, assign shelves by reading level, and cheer each other on with shared milestones. We'll guide
        you step-by-step.
      </p>
      <form class="signup-form">
        <label for="guardian-email" class="sr-only">Guardian email</label>
        <input id="guardian-email" type="email" placeholder="Guardian email" required />
        <button class="btn btn--primary" type="submit">Claim your free month</button>
      </form>
      <div class="signup-trust">
        <span class="fa fa-smile"></span> Loved by 2M+ young readers worldwide
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="reading-benefits" data-scroll-animate>
  <div class="reading-benefits__item">
    <h4>Guided journeys</h4>
    <p>Playful prompts and reading tips keep every chapter engaging—no more "Are we done yet?"</p>
  </div>
  <div class="reading-benefits__item">
    <h4>Progress you can trust</h4>
    <p>Real-time dashboards make it easy to see which badges are close and which skills to stretch next.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="reading-benefits__item">
    <h4>Joyful accessibility</h4>
    <p>High contrast modes, open dyslexic-friendly fonts, and audio companions meet every reader where they are.</p>
  </div>
</section>
